{"id":"pra_zise","lemma":"präzise","pos":"adj","rank":4970,"glosses":["precise"],"ipa":"/pʁɛ(ː)ˈt͡siːzə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8f/De-pr%C3%A4zise.ogg/De-pr%C3%A4zise.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"präziser","superlative":"am präzisesten"},"examples":[{"text":"Tom ist präzise.","en":"Tom is precise.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Er beschrieb präzise, was dort geschehen war.","en":"He accurately described what happened there.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to describe","l":"beschreiben"},null,{"g":"what"},{"g":"there, yonder"},{"g":"to occur"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Er gibt leicht verständliche, präzise Erklärungen.","en":"He gives plain, simple explanations.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"light"},null,null,{"g":"explanation","l":"Erklärung"}]},{"text":"Wir führten den Befehl des Kapitäns präzise aus.","en":"We carried out the captain's order to the letter.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to lead","l":"führen"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"command, order"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"captain","l":"Kapitän"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Sie führten den Befehl des Kapitäns präzise aus.","en":"They carried out the captain's order to the letter.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to lead","l":"führen"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"command, order"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"captain","l":"Kapitän"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]}]}